   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electricity supply restored and normal education services resumed at pre-Cyclone Ian levels for the people of Ha&amp;apos;apai</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education services resumed in the rebuilt and climate-proofed school buildings on Ha&amp;apos;apai 
Progress/Status: Reconstruction of 5 outer island GPS primary schools was completed in October 2015. 5 GPS and and 2 mission primary schools on Lifuka and Foa were completed in January 2016. Works at Ha&amp;apos;apai High school was completed and handed over in June 2016 with new Furniture. Contract awards for the 3 church managed high schools were made in June 2016 and works completed in Oct/Nov 2016. 
Data Source: Ministry of Education and Training (MET) reprots 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
